The files in documents/ other than INDEX.md are declassified documents of the United States government, released
through the CIA's FOIA reading room (https://www.cia.gov/readingroom). As works of the United States government they
are in the public domain. The page-25 text is the Monroe Institute's copy of the same government document, as it put
it on archive.org in 2021.
